# Zentory — Inventory Management System

## Tech Stack

Vanilla HTML5 + CSS3 + ES6+ JavaScript SPA. No build step, no bundler, no framework.
All dependencies loaded via CDN in `index.html`: Chart.js 4, jsPDF, jsPDF-AutoTable, Font Awesome 6, Google Fonts (Inter, Tiro Devanagari Marathi).

## Project Layout

```
inventory-management-system/
├── index.html          # SPA shell: auth screen + app views + all modals
├── css/style.css       # All styles (light + dark theme via CSS custom properties)
├── js/
│   ├── store.js        # Data layer — localStorage CRUD, seed data, IIFE: `Store`
│   ├── auth.js         # Auth — login, signup, demo login, switch user; IIFE: `Auth`
│   ├── app.js          # Orchestrator — init, routing, theme, nav, toasts; IIFE: `App`
│   ├── locations.js    # Location CRUD; IIFE: `Locations`
│   ├── products.js     # Product catalog; IIFE: `Products`
│   ├── inventory.js    # Stock grid (product × location); IIFE: `Inventory`
│   ├── orders.js       # Sales/Purchase order workflow; IIFE: `Orders`
│   ├── shop.js         # B2B marketplace browsing & cart; IIFE: `Shop`
│   ├── pos.js          # Point-of-sale counter; IIFE: `POS`
│   ├── bom.js          # Bill of Materials / recipes; IIFE: `BOM`
│   ├── khata.js        # Credit ledger (Khata); IIFE: `KhataModule`
│   ├── reports.js      # Advanced charts & reports; IIFE: `Reports`
│   ├── dashboard.js    # Dashboard stats & charts; IIFE: `Dashboard`
│   └── export.js       # CSV/PDF export; IIFE: `Export`
├── sw.js               # Service worker (PWA caching)
├── manifest.json       # PWA manifest
├── icons/icon.svg      # App icon
└── docs/MVP.md         # MVP requirements document
```

## Data Flow

All persistence uses `localStorage`. The `Store` IIFE is the single source of truth.
Modules call `Store.*` to read/write data, then re-render their own DOM.
`App._navigate(view)` handles view switching and triggers each module's `render()`/`refresh()`.

## Currency & Locale

All monetary values use ₹ (INR). The Unicode character `\u20B9` is used in JS string concatenation.

## Brand

Name: **Zentory** (Latin script, Inter font). Icon: Font Awesome `fa-bolt`. The Tiro Devanagari Marathi font is still loaded for the Marathi user guide (`guide-mr.html`), not the brand.
